<TXSPN>"At last, the second half. Quite a rich variety so far, but how will things go from here?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The ones left were me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
