{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh my, I'm next! Everyone's stories were so interesting, it's a little bit of pressure!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s voice was as high-energy as always―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">or so I thought, but she looked around at everyone with a sharp, serious gaze.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"As </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> said, we came back to Motoki-cho 10 years ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">When we came back to Motoki-cho, my health got better too, and I worked as hard as I could, enough for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s share as well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">A few years later, I was given a good opportunity, and I ended up founding a company.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\summer-night-country1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\駅前夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム2,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―Motoki-cho has just about every facility you need </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="そろ">right there</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, so not many people take the train out of town.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But back then... it would have been midsummer, about 5 years ago.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I had a trip planned out of town, so I decided to go by train.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\元木駅ホーム夜.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The meeting with the client was at 10 the next morning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was an overnight business trip.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Another matter had run late, so it was around 21:00 at night when I got to the station.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was a late train, so there was hardly anyone at the station.</STYLE><PG>
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">But the train seemed to be delayed, and when I asked the station staff why...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\和の廃墟.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed someone had gone onto the tracks at this platform.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But even though both the driver and the conductor had seen someone go onto the tracks, there was no one there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Not hit by the train, and not having gotten out of its way either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They said it would take a little time to find out what had happened to that person.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Actually, there was something on my mind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\電車女子高生2.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Unusually for Motoki-cho, someone had been hit by a train at the station the night before.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車汽笛.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\電車はねられる響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\電車女子高生1.gal" "WAIT" "2!" "200" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">A girl from Motoki High had been hit by the train, and her body was torn to pieces, I heard.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\なくした手.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">And I had heard that the girl's hands hadn't been found.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And now, right after that, the train was stopped for such an inexplicable reason, so the air didn't feel pleasant at all.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\元木駅ホーム夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">It was a midsummer night.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I remember it was hot even at night.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And Motoki Station doesn't have anything like an air-conditioned waiting room...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\自販機1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I went to buy something cold from the vending machine on the platform.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\小銭.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">It happened when I put my money in and went to buy what I wanted.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ドアがちゃがちゃ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\自販機2.gal" "WAIT" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "100" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\自販機売り切れ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "0" "C" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Suddenly the vending machine's lights went out, and every button lit up with 'Not Available.'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But my money didn't come back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I thought about calling the station staff, but at some point, everyone had gone from the platform.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">While I was thinking I'd lost a little money, I noticed something odd.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\自販機売り切れ2.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Looking closely, I saw that just one button didn't have the 'Not Available' light on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Well, if I pressed it and something came out, that'd be a </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="もう">lucky break</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">just as I went to press that button... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I noticed.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\自販機しみ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">There was a small red stain on that button.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Looking closely, I saw it was a bloodstain.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A bloodstain as if a single drop of blood had spattered there from a little way off.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And it still had a sheen... it wasn't completely dry.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The day before, a high-school girl had been hit by a train here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If this bloodstain was from then...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But it was too fresh for that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I hesitated to press the button.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That was when...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\恐怖BGM2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "2000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\自販機指紋.gal" "NORMAL" "11" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The bloodstain slowly spread, and a pattern rose to the surface.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That pattern was, unmistakably... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">a human fingerprint.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Was someone invisible pressing the button?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My legs started to shake.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I wanted to cry out, but I was too scared to make a sound.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\自販機ボタン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">And then, suddenly, I heard the sound of a vending machine button being pressed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But there was something strange about that sound too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Like the buzzer when a train departs...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\自販機取り出し口.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">And then, into the slot, something unidentifiable came falling, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\dressing.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">splat, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\dressing.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">splat.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Two of them, for some reason.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As if lumps of meat had dropped down...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't have the courage to take that unidentifiable thing out.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I stood frozen there for a while, but finally my feet began to move, and just as I tried to turn them toward where the station staff were...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\吐息.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
